  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.41 Planning board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.41 “Planning board” means “planning board” as defined in RSA 672:11, namely, a “city, town, village district, and county planning board, in counties which contain unincorporated towns or unorganized places, established under the provisions of RSA 673.”\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
